{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01JNmbPhQ6GDr8e2vsngyYKR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  4-model交叉分析完全验证2-model趋势：model×item=24.1%维持为第二大方差来源（MMLU），\n  跨模型G=0.065，D-study证明即使10模型G仅0.179——model×item是不可约的结构性障碍。\n  跨benchmark梯度完美单调：MMLU(60.4%)→HellaSwag(50.4%)→ARC-C(42.1%)→GSM8K(28.3%)，\n  秩相关=1.0，spread=32.1pp。\"方差结构本身是benchmark-conditional的\"叙事完全成立。\n  Claim 1升级为\"model-conditional item dominance is a fundamental, benchmark-modulated barrier\"。\n  Claim 2经多硬件确认separability（hardware×methodology=0.18%<0.5%）。\n  Claim 3的D-study预算表跨4benchmark揭示推理型benchmark可复现性成本为知识型的1.9倍\n  （GSM8K 900 items vs MMLU 480 items）。IRT vs G-theory 4.4×差距作为独立贡献。\n  全部9项MD防御通过。P0五实验全部按时完成。投稿AAAI，目标7.0+/10。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Full-scale 4-model MMLU precision study\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001\"\n    description: >\n      4 models (Qwen3-8B, Llama-3.1-8B, Gemma-2-9B, Mistral-7B) × 3 precisions\n      (Gemma仅bf16+fp32) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items.\n      V0 enforce_eager统一引擎消除float32混淆。核心：4模型交叉验证2模型的model×item交互。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 891200\n      models_completed: 4\n      per_model_accuracy_bf16:\n        llama: 0.711\n        gemma: 0.732\n        mistral: 0.685\n        qwen3: 0.748\n      single_model_item_id_pct_llama: 61.1\n      single_model_item_id_pct_gemma: 58.7\n      single_model_item_id_pct_mistral: 59.4\n      single_model_item_id_pct_qwen3: 62.3\n      single_model_item_id_pct_mean: 60.4\n      single_model_G_binary_mean: 0.618\n      cross_4model_item_id_pct: 36.8\n      cross_4model_model_pct: 8.3\n      cross_4model_model_x_item_pct: 24.1\n      cross_4model_precision_pct: 1.4\n      cross_4model_prompt_x_item_pct: 3.2\n      cross_4model_seed_x_item_pct: 3.1\n      cross_4model_temp_x_item_pct: 2.1\n      cross_4model_prec_x_item_pct: 1.8\n      cross_4model_ordering_x_item_pct: 0.3\n      cross_4model_infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.08\n      cross_4model_residual_pct: 18.8\n      cross_model_G_4model: 0.065\n      d_study_10models_G: 0.179\n      d_study_items_G80_practical: 480\n      d_study_items_G80_all_random: 540\n    result_rationale: >\n      model×item从2模型26.2%略降至4模型24.1%：增加Mistral和Qwen3扩大了模型多样性\n      （Llama/Mistral=相似decoder架构，Gemma=独特norm结构，Qwen3=GQA+SwiGLU变体），\n      但4模型的averaging效应会平滑个别模型对之间的极端分歧——2模型时Llama-Gemma的\n      item difficulty rank disagreement被完全捕获，4模型时某些model-pair间的agreement\n      部分抵消了其他pair的disagreement，导致总model×item略低。但24.1%仍远高于任何\n      其他非item来源，确认model×item是系统性的而非2-model noise。\n\n      单模型item_id维持55-65%因为200-item MMLU的分层抽样覆盖STEM/humanities/social/other，\n      学科间难度跨度大(STEM>60%错误率 vs social<30%)，这种异质性在任何单模型下都表现为\n      高item方差。Qwen3最高(62.3%)因为其accuracy最高(74.8%)，high-accuracy模型的item\n      responses更趋向两极化(更多items被稳定地答对或答错)，增大了item间方差。\n\n      跨模型G=0.065：4模型引入更多model×item来源，G从0.073(2模型)降至0.065。\n      D-study投影10模型G=0.179证明model×item不可通过增加模型数量来消除——\n      这是模型架构和训练数据差异导致的item difficulty系统性重排，不是采样噪声。\n\n      infra×method<0.1%(binary)：V0 enforce_eager消除了引擎混淆，二值评分下\n      精度差异主要影响绝对水平，不产生precision×prompt或precision×seed的交互。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 1: Single-model variance decomposition (binary, MMLU, 4 models)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=variance sources (item_id, precision, prompt×item, seed×item, temp×item, prec×item, ordering×item, residual); Columns=Llama, Gemma, Mistral, Qwen3, Mean\"\n        highlight: \"item_id: 61.1, 58.7, 59.4, 62.3, mean=60.4%; residual: 21.6, 22.4, 21.9, 20.8\"\n      - title: \"Table 2: Cross-model 4-way variance decomposition (binary, MMLU)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=variance sources incl. model, model×item; Columns=% variance, bootstrap 95% CI, significance\"\n        highlight: \"model×item: 24.1% [21.3, 27.0] p<0.001; item_id: 36.8% [33.5, 40.2]; model: 8.3% [5.1, 12.4]\"\n      - title: \"Table 3: G-coefficient comparison — single vs cross-model\"\n        structure: \"Rows=Llama, Gemma, Mistral, Qwen3, 2-model cross, 4-model cross; Columns=G(binary), G(text), items for G≥0.80\"\n        highlight: \"G collapse: single mean 0.618 → 4-model cross 0.065; D-study 10-model G=0.179\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure 1 (reveal figure): Paired stacked bars. Left bar=single-model mean decomposition\n        (item_id=60.4% dominates). Right bar=4-model cross decomposition (item_id shrinks to 36.8%,\n        model×item=24.1% appears as large new wedge, model=8.3%). Annotated arrows show\n        item_id↓23.6pp and model×item emergence. G value labels (0.618→0.065) at top.\n    analysis: >\n      分析流程：(1) 4模型分别运行5-facet G-study(prec×prompt×seed×temp×ordering×item)，\n      确认item_id在55-65%；(2) 合并数据，model作为crossed random facet运行6-facet G-study，\n      使用bf16+fp32平衡子集(Gemma限制)；(3) D-study投影：固定prec+temp后，items 100→2000，\n      绘制G曲线；(4) 与2-model结果对比。Gemma仅有bf16+fp32，跨模型分析使用2-precision平衡子集。\n\n  - name: \"Item resampling stability test\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001b\"\n    description: >\n      3组独立分层200-item MMLU样本(seeds 0,7,99) × Llama × 3 prec × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings\n      = 54 conditions/sample × 200 items = 10,800 records/sample。验证item dominance非抽样伪影。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 32400\n      records_per_sample: 10800\n      conditions_per_sample: 54\n      item_id_sample_seed0: 57.8\n      item_id_sample_seed7: 62.5\n      item_id_sample_seed99: 60.1\n      item_id_mean: 60.13\n      item_id_sd: 2.37\n      resampling_item_id_cv: 0.039\n      G_sample_seed0: 0.594\n      G_sample_seed7: 0.631\n      G_sample_seed99: 0.612\n      G_mean: 0.612\n      G_cv: 0.030\n      variance_rank_order_preserved: true\n      prompt_x_item_cv: 0.061\n      seed_x_item_cv: 0.073\n      residual_cv: 0.044\n    result_rationale: >\n      CV=0.039(远低于15%阈值)的原因：MMLU分层抽样确保每组200 items按学科比例分配\n      (STEM/humanities/social/other各~50题)。item dominance主要源于两层异质性：\n      (1)学科间——STEM题目系统性更难(平均accuracy ~55%)vs social science(~78%)，\n      这个学科间差异在任何分层样本中都被保留；\n      (2)学科内——同一学科的知识点覆盖面广(abstract_algebra vs high_school_math)，\n      不同知识点的难度差异在充分大的样本(200题)中被稳定采样。\n\n      样本间波动(57.8%-62.5%)的来源：seed7恰好抽到了更多高区分度items\n      (如advanced mathematics中的证明题和abstract algebra)，这些items的accuracy\n      跨条件变异更大，推高item_id。seed0抽到的items difficulty分布更均匀(中等难度居多)，\n      item间差异较小，item_id略低。但这5pp的波动相对于60%的基线是trivial的。\n\n      G系数的CV(0.030)甚至低于item_id的CV，因为G是item_id的归一化函数——\n      分子(signal=item variance)和分母(total variance)同方向波动，比值更稳定。\n\n      所有variance sources的rank order在3组间完全一致\n      (item_id>>residual>prompt×item≈seed×item>其他)，\n      证明方差结构是MMLU的内在属性而非特定200-item样本的伪影。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 4: Resampling stability — variance decomposition across 3 item draws\"\n        structure: \"Rows=item_id, prompt×item, seed×item, prec×item, residual, other; Columns=Sample A(s0), B(s7), C(s99), Mean, SD, CV\"\n        highlight: \"item_id: 57.8/62.5/60.1, CV=0.039; rank order identical across all 3 samples\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Supplementary: Three stacked bars (one per sample), nearly identical structure.\n        Bootstrap 95% CIs shown as whiskers, overlapping across all samples.\n        Dashed horizontal line at sample mean for item_id.\n    analysis: >\n      (1) 用3个不同random seeds对MMLU 14K items进行分层抽样(按57个subject等比例)；\n      (2) 每组200 items × 54 conditions运行完整G-study；\n      (3) 计算每个variance component的cross-sample CV和rank order一致性；\n      (4) Friedman检验确认rank order无显著差异(p>0.10)。\n\n  - name: \"Multi-benchmark cross-task replication\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16; Gemma用BF16/FP32) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds ×\n      2 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 items on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag.\n      核心实验：建立跨benchmark方差梯度。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 1382400\n      records_per_benchmark: 460800\n      # --- HellaSwag (commonsense) ---\n      hellaswag_single_model_item_id_pct: 50.4\n      hellaswag_prompt_x_item_pct: 5.4\n      hellaswag_seed_x_item_pct: 4.9\n      hellaswag_temp_x_item_pct: 5.2\n      hellaswag_residual_pct: 21.3\n      hellaswag_cross_model_item_id_pct: 33.2\n      hellaswag_model_x_item_pct: 21.3\n      hellaswag_model_pct: 8.7\n      hellaswag_cross_model_G: 0.058\n      hellaswag_single_model_G: 0.548\n      hellaswag_d_study_items_G80: 550\n      # --- ARC-Challenge (science reasoning) ---\n      arc_single_model_item_id_pct: 42.1\n      arc_prompt_x_item_pct: 7.3\n      arc_seed_x_item_pct: 5.8\n      arc_temp_x_item_pct: 6.5\n      arc_model_pct: 9.8\n      arc_residual_pct: 20.5\n      arc_cross_model_item_id_pct: 27.4\n      arc_model_x_item_pct: 22.7\n      arc_cross_model_G: 0.052\n      arc_single_model_G: 0.495\n      arc_d_study_items_G80: 650\n      # --- GSM8K (math reasoning) ---\n      gsm8k_single_model_item_id_pct: 28.3\n      gsm8k_prompt_x_item_pct: 11.8\n      gsm8k_seed_x_item_pct: 8.2\n      gsm8k_temp_x_item_pct: 9.4\n      gsm8k_model_pct: 12.4\n      gsm8k_residual_pct: 18.2\n      gsm8k_cross_model_item_id_pct: 16.5\n      gsm8k_model_x_item_pct: 23.5\n      gsm8k_cross_model_G: 0.041\n      gsm8k_single_model_G: 0.385\n      gsm8k_d_study_items_G80: 900\n      # --- Cross-benchmark gradient ---\n      gradient_item_id_MMLU: 60.4\n      gradient_item_id_HellaSwag: 50.4\n      gradient_item_id_ARC: 42.1\n      gradient_item_id_GSM8K: 28.3\n      gradient_spread_pp: 32.1\n      gradient_rank_correlation: 1.0\n      model_x_item_range: \"21.3-24.1% across all benchmarks\"\n      cross_model_G_range: \"0.041-0.065 across all benchmarks\"\n      separability_binary_all_lt_0_5pct: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      跨benchmark梯度单调递减的逐级机制解释：\n\n      MMLU(知识检索, item_id=60.4%): 题目考察封闭式事实(如\"RNA聚合酶的功能\")。\n      item difficulty取决于知识点的稀有程度和训练数据覆盖，这对同一模型的不同\n      prompt/seed/temperature非常稳定——模型要么在训练语料中见过这个fact，要么没有。\n      改变prompt措辞(\"Answer the following\"→\"Select the correct option\")不会让模型\n      突然\"知道\"之前不知道的知识。temperature的影响也小——T=0.0和T=0.3下，\n      知识检索的top token概率通常>0.9，sampling几乎不改变结果。因此item_id占主导60%+。\n\n      HellaSwag(常识推理, item_id=50.4%, ↓10pp): 题目要求基于日常场景选择合理的continuation。\n      item difficulty仍有较强结构(某些场景本质上更容易判断，如\"厨师拿起刀→开始切菜\"\n      vs 模糊场景)，但prompt措辞开始影响模型对场景的\"理解角度\"——不同prompt可能\n      引导模型关注不同的context cue，导致prompt×item从MMLU的3.2%升至5.4%。\n      temperature的影响也增大(5.2% vs 2.1%)因为常识推理的答案概率分布更平坦(top token\n      概率~0.6-0.8)，sampling噪声有更大机会翻转结果。\n\n      ARC-Challenge(科学推理, item_id=42.1%, ↓8pp): 题目需要多步科学推理\n      (如\"如果地球轴倾斜增大，对季节有什么影响→更极端\")。推理路径的选择更依赖\n      prompt引导——few-shot示例的推理风格会bias模型的reasoning approach，\n      prompt×item升至7.3%。seed×item=5.8%反映了多步推理中采样分支点的影响。\n      model间的科学推理能力差异更显著(model=9.8% vs MMLU 8.3%)——\n      有些模型(Qwen3)在STEM训练上投入更多，而有些(Mistral)偏向语言任务。\n\n      GSM8K(数学推理, item_id=28.3%, ↓14pp): 多步算术(平均4-6步)使每一步成为随机分支点。\n      temperature直接控制chain-of-thought的随机性(temp×item=9.4%, MMLU的4.5倍)——\n      T=0.7时同一题可能生成完全不同的解题路径，有的正确有的错误。\n      prompt格式影响极大(prompt×item=11.8%)：few-shot示例中的解题格式\n      (\"Let's think step by step\" vs \"Solution:\" vs 无CoT)直接决定模型是否使用\n      chain-of-thought，对不同难度的item影响截然不同——简单加减题不需要CoT也能对，\n      但复杂分数题没有CoT就会失败。seed×item=8.2%因为多步生成过程中的\n      cumulative sampling variance在长输出中被放大。\n\n      model×item在所有benchmark维持20-24%的原因：不同模型的训练数据和架构差异\n      导致model-specific的知识和能力profile——Qwen3可能在数学上强但常识弱，\n      Gemma可能科学推理强但数学弱。这种model-specific的item ranking在所有task type上\n      都产生显著交互，而且不随benchmark类型系统性变化——它是模型多样性的反映而非\n      task type的函数。\n\n      D-study预算梯度(MMLU 480→GSM8K 900 items)的解释：\n      推理型benchmark的非item方差(prompt×item + temp×item + seed×item)合计\n      从MMLU的~9%增至GSM8K的~29%。要在这些额外噪声源存在的情况下仍达到G≥0.80，\n      需要更多items来提高signal-to-noise ratio。GSM8K需要近2倍于MMLU的items，\n      揭示\"推理型benchmark的可复现性成本远高于知识型\"——这是一个有直接实践意义的发现。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 5: Cross-benchmark single-model variance decomposition (binary)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=item_id, prompt×item, seed×item, temp×item, prec×item, ordering×item, residual, other; Columns=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K\"\n        highlight: \"item_id: 60.4→50.4→42.1→28.3 (monotonic ↓); prompt×item: 3.2→5.4→7.3→11.8 (monotonic ↑); temp×item: 2.1→5.2→6.5→9.4 (monotonic ↑)\"\n      - title: \"Table 6: Cross-model (4-model) decomposition per benchmark\"\n        structure: \"Rows=benchmark; Columns=item_id%, model%, model×item%, cross-model G, D-study items G≥0.80\"\n        highlight: \"model×item: MMLU 24.1, HellaSwag 21.3, ARC 22.7, GSM8K 23.5 — all ≥20%\"\n      - title: \"Table 7: Benchmark-specific D-study reproducibility budgets\"\n        structure: \"Rows=benchmark; Columns=items(practical), prompts, seeds, total conditions, est. GPU-hours per model\"\n        highlight: \"MMLU: 480 items × 3 prompts × 4 seeds; GSM8K: 900 items × 4 prompts × 6 seeds\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure 2 (gradient figure, core novel finding): Four stacked bars arranged\n        MMLU→HellaSwag→ARC→GSM8K. item_id wedge visually shrinks left→right (blue).\n        prompt×item (orange) and temp×item (red) wedges grow. Monotonic gradient\n        immediately visible. Bracket annotations show spread=32.1pp. Spearman ρ=1.0 labeled.\n      - >\n        Figure 3 (D-study budget comparison): Four D-study curves (G vs items),\n        one per benchmark. MMLU reaches G=0.80 first (~480 items), GSM8K last (~900 items).\n        Horizontal dashed lines at G=0.70 and G=0.80. Shaded region below G=0.80 labeled\n        \"unreliable zone.\" Inset shows current practice (200 items) falls below 0.80 for all benchmarks.\n    analysis: >\n      (1) 每个benchmark的6 prompt templates需要benchmark-specific设计(GSM8K用CoT variants,\n      ARC用science reasoning templates, HellaSwag用completion templates)；\n      (2) 4 ordering rotations: ABCD→BCDA→CDAB→DABC for MC benchmarks; GSM8K无ordering facet\n      (开放式生成)，用4个不同的few-shot exemplar sets替代；\n      (3) 分别对每个benchmark运行single-model和4-model G-study；\n      (4) 计算跨benchmark Spearman ρ(item_id排序 vs 先验reasoning complexity排序)；\n      (5) 对每个benchmark运行D-study grid search(items×prompts×seeds)找G≥0.80最优配置。\n\n  - name: \"Multi-hardware separability G-study\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      4 models × 2 GPU types × 2 precisions (BF16, FP16/FP32) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds ×\n      3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items. Claim 2核心实验：\n      测试hardware×methodology交互，证明基础设施和方法论因素可分离。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records_analyzed: 1382400\n      new_records_gpu2: 691200\n      gpu_types: [\"RTX PRO 6000 (Blackwell)\", \"TBD second GPU\"]\n      gpu_type_main_effect_pct: 0.12\n      hardware_x_methodology_binary_pct: 0.18\n      hardware_x_prompt_pct: 0.05\n      hardware_x_seed_pct: 0.02\n      hardware_x_temperature_binary_pct: 0.04\n      hardware_x_ordering_pct: 0.07\n      hardware_x_item_pct: 1.2\n      precision_x_hardware_pct: 0.35\n      hardware_x_temperature_text_pct: 0.83\n      separability_confirmed_binary: true\n      item_id_with_hardware: 59.8\n      variance_structure_consistent_with_exp001: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      hardware×methodology=0.18%(binary)的物理解释：两种GPU微架构(如Blackwell vs Ampere)\n      的浮点运算单元实现不同——Tensor Core的矩阵乘法顺序、warp-level reduction的\n      累加顺序都不同。但在BF16/FP16下，这些数值差异只影响最后1-2 bits of mantissa。\n      对于binary scoring，一个item的正确/错误判定取决于top token概率是否最高——\n      只有当两个选项的概率差<0.001时，GPU差异才可能翻转结果。这种\"边界item\"在200题中\n      约3-5题，且它们与prompt/seed的交互在统计上不可与noise区分，因此\n      hardware×prompt和hardware×seed都<0.1%。\n\n      hardware×item=1.2%高于hardware×methodology的原因：这1.2%来自那些确实被\n      GPU差异翻转的边界items——它们的翻转是item-specific的(取决于item的概率分布形状)，\n      而非methodology-specific的。这是item-conditional的hardware效应，\n      不违反separability——separability关注的是hardware是否调节methodology的效应，\n      而hardware×item只说明hardware的效应是item-dependent的(符合预期)。\n\n      text_exact_match下hardware×temperature=0.83%：文本精确匹配对生成过程中的\n      任何微小概率差异都敏感(不同token选择→不同字符串→match失败)。\n      temperature放大了GPU数值差异的影响——T=0.7时sampling distribution更平坦，\n      GPU间mantissa差异更有可能改变sampled token。但0.83%仍<1%，\n      与Messina & Scotta (2026)的FP非结合性理论预测量级一致。\n\n      整体方差结构与exp-001一致(item_id=59.8% vs 60.4%)，\n      hardware facet仅\"吸收\"了0.6pp的原属residual的方差，\n      证明单GPU实验的结论不因hardware选择而改变。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 8: Hardware-crossed variance decomposition (binary, MMLU, 4 models × 2 GPUs)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=all sources including 6 hardware interaction terms; Columns=% variance, 95% CI, significant?\"\n        highlight: \"hardware: 0.12% [0.02,0.31]; hw×method(aggregate): 0.18% [0.03,0.42]; hw×item: 1.2% [0.7,1.8]\"\n      - title: \"Table 9: Metric-conditional separability test\"\n        structure: \"Rows=hardware interaction terms; Columns=binary %, text_exact_match %, difference\"\n        highlight: \"hw×temp: binary 0.04% vs text 0.83%; separability is metric-conditional\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Supplementary: Heatmap of all infrastructure×methodology interaction terms\n        (rows=infra factors, cols=method factors). Binary panel: all cells <0.5% (cool colors).\n        Text panel: hw×temp cell at 0.83% (warm spot). Diagonal of hardware×item\n        shown separately at 1.2%.\n    analysis: >\n      (1) 在第2种GPU上运行与exp-001匹配的设计(4模型 × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings)；\n      (2) 合并两GPU数据，hardware作为crossed facet运行G-study；\n      (3) 分别提取所有hardware×methodology和hardware×item交互项；\n      (4) binary和text_exact_match分别分析；\n      (5) bootstrap CI检验每个hardware交互项是否显著异于0。\n\n  - name: \"Comprehensive combined analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: >\n      对exp-001/001b/002/003的全部数据进行17项系统分析(a-q)。纯分析实验(0 GPU hours)。\n      涵盖model-as-facet、bootstrap CIs、IRT对比、全部9项MD防御、power analysis、\n      practitioner toolkit生成。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records_analyzed: 4288000\n      # --- (a) Model-as-facet (covered in exp-001 results above) ---\n      # --- (b) Bootstrap CIs ---\n      bootstrap_resamples: 1000\n      ci_model_x_item_95: [21.3, 27.0]\n      ci_item_id_95: [33.5, 40.2]\n      ci_cross_model_G_95: [0.048, 0.083]\n      all_key_cis_exclude_zero: true\n      # --- (c) D-study with CIs ---\n      d_study_items_G80_practical_ci: [445, 520]\n      d_study_items_G80_all_random_ci: [495, 590]\n      # --- (d) REML vs Henderson ---\n      reml_vs_henderson_max_diff_pct: 1.4\n      reml_vs_henderson_rank_preserved: true\n      # --- (e) Logprob scoring ---\n      logprob_item_id_pct_mmlu: 53.2\n      logprob_G_mmlu: 0.572\n      logprob_vs_binary_rank_correlation: 0.94\n      # --- (f) Ranking stability ---\n      precision_x_temp_alters_model_ranking: false\n      kendall_tau_across_conditions: 0.94\n      # --- (g) Higher-order interactions ---\n      higher_order_total_pct: 3.2\n      largest_3way: \"prec×temp×item = 1.1%\"\n      # --- (h) IRT vs G-theory ---\n      irt_mmlu_items: 116\n      gtheory_mmlu_items: 510\n      irt_gtheory_ratio_mmlu: 4.40\n      irt_gtheory_ratio_hellaswag: 4.20\n      irt_gtheory_ratio_arc: 4.35\n      irt_gtheory_ratio_gsm8k: 4.65\n      irt_gtheory_ratio_mean: 4.40\n      gtheory_G_at_irt_recommendation: 0.529\n      # --- (i) Power analysis ---\n      power_5pct_interaction: 0.998\n      min_detectable_interaction_80pct_power: 1.2\n      # --- (k) Fixed vs random sensitivity (MD2) ---\n      fixed_vs_random_item_id_change_pct: 2.8\n      fixed_vs_random_G_change: 0.032\n      # --- (l) Binary data defense (MD1) ---\n      bernoulli_observed_correlation: 0.68\n      null_simulation_item_id_pct: 0.09\n      observed_over_null_ratio: 671\n      # --- (m) Bootstrap vs jackknife (MD6) ---\n      bootstrap_jackknife_ci_width_ratio_range: [0.96, 1.04]\n      # --- (n) 2×2 vs 3×3 sensitivity (MD8) ---\n      mmlu_2x2_vs_3x3_item_id_diff_pct: 3.6\n      # --- (o) G at full MMLU (MD5) ---\n      g_at_14k_mmlu_items: 0.943\n      # --- (p) Logprob across benchmarks (MD9) ---\n      logprob_item_id_gradient: \"MMLU 53.2→HellaSwag 44.1→ARC 37.8→GSM8K 24.6\"\n      # --- (q) GPU cost ---\n      gpu_hours_mmlu_G80_per_model: 48\n      gpu_hours_gsm8k_G80_per_model: 135\n      # --- Practitioner protocol ---\n      recommended_min_prompts: 3\n      recommended_min_seeds: 4\n      recommended_temperature: 0.0\n      recommended_min_items_knowledge: 480\n      recommended_min_items_reasoning: 900\n    result_rationale: >\n      IRT vs G-theory 4.4×差距的机制：\n      IRT(Rasch/2PL)将response建模为θ_person和b_item的函数，所有非item因素\n      (prompt, seed, ordering)被折入error term。因此IRT的\"reliable measurement\"\n      只要求item difficulty参数估计稳定——116 items足以稳定估计200个difficulty参数\n      (Rasch的渐近效率在~100 items时充分)。\n      G-theory将prompt×item(4.6%), seed×item(4.7%), ordering×item等作为系统性方差分离出来，\n      G系数的分母包含这些维度的方差。要在同时考虑prompt/seed/ordering变异的情况下\n      仍达到G≥0.80，需要510 items——额外的394 items用于\"吸收\"IRT忽略的非item噪声。\n      在IRT推荐的116 items处，G-theory G仅0.529——这就是\"多facet reliability的代价\"。\n\n      GSM8K的ratio(4.65×)高于MMLU(4.40×)因为数学任务的prompt/seed/temperature方差更大，\n      G-theory需要吸收的额外噪声更多，而IRT仍只看item discrimination(GSM8K items的\n      discrimination通常更高——数学题更能区分能力，因此IRT需要的items反而更少)。\n\n      bootstrap CI [21.3, 27.0] on model×item不含0的原因：4模型×200 items的设计\n      每个model×item cell有864个重复(6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 2 prec × 2 GPU)，\n      power分析显示对≥1.2% interaction effect的检测power>0.80，\n      对≥5% effect的power>0.998。24.1%的效应量远超检测阈值。\n\n      fixed vs random sensitivity仅2.8%变化(MD2)：temperature虽只有3个设计点，\n      但在G-theory中fixed/random的区别仅影响temperature方差是否进入G系数分母。\n      temperature main effect<2%，fixed→random只增加分母~2%→item_id%变化2.8%。\n      这证明即使temperature不满足\"从universe随机抽样\"的理想假设，结论仍稳健。\n\n      binary data defense(MD1): r(Bernoulli p(1-p), observed)=0.68表明~46%的item\n      variance可归因于Bernoulli机制(difficulty p决定p(1-p))，但null simulation\n      (random p_i ~ Uniform, item_id=0.09%)证明仅Bernoulli机制不产生我们观察到的\n      61%方差——实际值是null的671倍。另外54%的\"超Bernoulli\"item variance反映了\n      items间真实的知识点差异和cognitive demand差异。\n\n      G at 14K items=0.943(MD5)：D-study投影f(n_items)是log-concave的，\n      200→14K items的G提升(0.618→0.943)证明完整MMLU的reliability远高于\n      200-item子集。我们的发现是\"子抽样的成本\"而非\"MMLU本身不可靠\"。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 10: IRT vs G-theory item requirements (4 benchmarks)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K; Columns=IRT items, G-theory items, ratio, G-theory G at IRT items, extra sources\"\n        highlight: \"MMLU: 116 vs 510 (4.4×), G=0.529 at 116; GSM8K: 82 vs 381 (4.65×)\"\n      - title: \"Table 11: Bootstrap 95% CIs on variance components (MMLU, 4-model cross)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=all variance sources; Columns=point %, lower CI, upper CI, excludes 0?\"\n        highlight: \"model×item [21.3,27.0] excludes 0 ✓; infra×method [0.0,0.42] includes 0 ✓\"\n      - title: \"Table 12: Methodological defense summary (MD1-MD9)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=MD1 binary data through MD9 title alignment; Columns=test, threshold, result, verdict\"\n        highlight: \"All 9 defenses pass: MD1 671× null, MD2 <5% change, MD3 qualified, MD4 monotonic, MD5 0.943, MD6 ratio 0.96-1.04, MD7 4.4× ratio, MD8 <5% change, MD9 logprob expanded\"\n      - title: \"Table 13: Benchmark-specific D-study reproducibility budget (G≥0.80)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K; Columns=items, prompts, seeds, total conditions, est. GPU-hours, comparison to current practice\"\n        highlight: \"MMLU 480×3×4, GSM8K 900×4×6; current practice (200×1×1) yields G=0.385-0.618\"\n      - title: \"Table 14: GPU cost estimates for recommended budgets\"\n        structure: \"Rows=benchmark; Columns=items, prompts, seeds, hours/model (8B), hours/model (14B)\"\n        highlight: \"MMLU ~48h, GSM8K ~135h (8B model on single GPU)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure 4 (IRT vs G-theory): Stacked bar pair per benchmark. Left bar (IRT, narrow):\n        116 items single color. Right bar (G-theory, wide): 510 items stacked—base 116 items\n        (same color as IRT), extra items partitioned into prompt×item portion (orange),\n        seed×item portion (green), residual portion (gray). Visual immediately shows\n        \"where the extra items go.\"\n      - >\n        Figure 5 (temperature×metric heatmap): 2 rows (binary, text_exact_match) × 3 columns\n        (T=0.0, T=0.3, T=0.7). Cell color=G value. Binary row: gradual degradation\n        0.760→0.624→0.549. Text row: 0.058→0.011→0.007 (near-zero across all T>0).\n        Stark contrast between rows.\n    analysis: >\n      17项分析按依赖关系分3波执行：\n      Wave 1 (独立，可并行): bootstrap CIs(b), jackknife CIs(m), fixed/random(k),\n      binary defense(l), REML vs Henderson(d), 2×2 vs 3×3(n), power(i), logprob(e,p).\n      Wave 2 (需Wave 1 CIs): model-as-facet final(a), D-study with CIs(c),\n      higher-order(g), ranking stability(f).\n      Wave 3 (需全部benchmark数据): IRT comparison(h), cross-benchmark budget(j,q),\n      G@14K(o), practitioner protocol(j).\n\n  - name: \"14B model scale extension\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B在datacenter GPU上运行BF16/FP16 × MMLU 200 items。\n      测试模型规模(8B→14B)和架构(dense vs reasoning-distilled)对方差层级的影响。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 345600\n      qwen3_14b_accuracy_bf16: 0.792\n      deepseek_r1_14b_accuracy_bf16: 0.803\n      qwen3_14b_item_id_pct: 63.8\n      deepseek_r1_14b_item_id_pct: 61.2\n      scale_14b_item_id_mean: 62.5\n      scale_8b_item_id_mean: 60.4\n      scale_delta_pp: 2.1\n      scale_delta_significant: false\n      single_model_G_14b_mean: 0.642\n      cross_model_2x14b_model_x_item_pct: 22.4\n      variance_hierarchy_preserved: true\n      prompt_x_item_14b_mean: 3.8\n      seed_x_item_14b_mean: 4.1\n      residual_14b_mean: 19.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      14B模型item_id略高于8B(62.5% vs 60.4%, +2.1pp，不显著)的原因：\n      14B模型的知识覆盖更广(训练参数多50-75%)，使得item difficulty的\"已知/未知\"\n      二分更加清晰——更多items被稳定答对(高置信度)或仍然稳定答错(超出能力范围)，\n      item间的正确率差异(variance)更大。但增幅很小因为MMLU的difficulty分布跨度大，\n      即使14B模型也在高难度STEM题上系统性失败(如abstract_algebra正确率<30%)。\n\n      方差层级完全保持(item_id>>prompt×item≈seed×item>residual>其他)的原因：\n      方差decomposition的结构主要取决于experimental design(多少个prompt, seed, item)\n      和benchmark的内在特性(知识vs推理)，而非模型能力水平。更强的模型只是\n      右移了accuracy分布，但各facet的相对贡献不变——prompt×item反映的是prompt\n      措辞与item知识点的交互，这种交互在8B和14B上都存在且比例相似。\n\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B(reasoning distillation)在MMLU上不改变方差结构，\n      因为MMLU主要考察知识而非推理——reasoning distillation优化的是chain-of-thought\n      推理能力，但MMLU的MC选择不需要长推理链。R1-Distill的影响在GSM8K/MATH上\n      会更显著(作为future work的motivation)。\n\n      cross-model model×item=22.4%(2个14B模型)仍>20%，证明model×item交互\n      不随scale减弱——即使是更大更强的模型，它们之间的item-level disagreement\n      仍然substantial。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Supplementary Table S1: 8B vs 14B variance decomposition comparison\"\n        structure: \"Rows=variance sources; Columns=8B mean(4 models), Qwen3-14B, DeepSeek-R1-14B, 14B mean\"\n        highlight: \"item_id: 60.4(8B) vs 63.8/61.2(14B); hierarchy rank identical\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Supplementary figure: Overlay of 8B(semi-transparent) and 14B stacked bars.\n        Structures nearly identical. Annotation: \"scale does not qualitatively alter\n        variance hierarchy.\"\n    analysis: >\n      (1) 在datacenter GPU上运行标准design(与exp-001 Llama配置一致)；\n      (2) paired comparison: 计算每个variance component的8B→14B delta及bootstrap CI；\n      (3) 如果所有delta的CI含0→结论：scale是二阶调节因素。\n      注意：14B需要≥48GB VRAM，可能需要tensor parallelism，这本身引入了额外的\n      数值非确定性(跨GPU通信的reduce顺序不同)，需要作为limitation讨论。\n\n  - name: \"Fine-tuning G-study (RoBERTa-large)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA: 6 seeds × 3 learning rates × 4 data shuffles\n      × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1,728 total fine-tuning runs.\n      测试inference vs fine-tuning的方差层级是否存在质变。\n    expected_results:\n      total_fine_tuning_runs: 1728\n      runs_per_task: 432\n      # --- Averaged across 4 tasks ---\n      ft_seed_x_lr_pct: 28.4\n      ft_item_id_pct: 31.7\n      ft_data_shuffle_x_item_pct: 12.3\n      ft_lr_main_pct: 8.9\n      ft_seed_main_pct: 6.2\n      ft_gpu_x_precision_pct: 0.4\n      ft_residual_pct: 12.1\n      ft_G_mean: 0.487\n      # --- Per-task breakdown ---\n      ft_item_id_sst2: 24.8\n      ft_item_id_mnli: 33.5\n      ft_item_id_rte: 38.2\n      ft_item_id_copa: 30.4\n      ft_seed_x_lr_sst2: 32.1\n      ft_seed_x_lr_mnli: 25.8\n      ft_seed_x_lr_rte: 26.4\n      ft_seed_x_lr_copa: 29.2\n      key_finding: \"Variance hierarchy qualitatively differs: fine-tuning is seed×lr-dominated; inference is item-dominated\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fine-tuning与inference方差结构的质变解释：\n\n      inference中方差来源仅限于evaluation-time因素——模型参数固定，变异只来自\n      \"如何问\"(prompt, ordering)和\"问什么\"(item)，因此item_id主导(60%+)。\n\n      fine-tuning引入training-time方差源，彻底改变了方差层级：\n      (1) seed×lr=28.4%成为最大来源：random seed决定参数初始化和dropout mask，\n      learning rate决定优化轨迹的aggressive程度。seed和lr的交互极强因为：\n      不同初始化在不同lr下可能converge到loss landscape的不同local minima，\n      产生的decision boundary在specific items上有系统性差异。\n      高lr+某些seed组合可能skip过optimal basin导致特定item类型的性能退化。\n\n      (2) item_id降至31.7%：fine-tuned RoBERTa在SST-2/MNLI上accuracy>90%，\n      大多数items被所有模型变体正确分类——item间difficulty差异被compression到\n      narrow range(90-99% correct)。相比inference时60-80%的accuracy范围，\n      fine-tuning后item间variance空间更小，因此item_id的相对占比下降。\n      SST-2的item_id最低(24.8%)因为task最简单(accuracy~94%)，items间差异最小。\n      RTE的item_id最高(38.2%)因为task最难(accuracy~72%)，items间差异更大。\n\n      (3) data_shuffle×item=12.3%：training examples的呈现顺序影响哪些patterns\n      被\"最后学到\"(recency effect)。由于catastrophic forgetting，后见examples的\n      patterns被更好地记住——不同shuffle导致不同items受益或受损，产生item-conditional效应。\n\n      (4) GPU×precision=0.4%：与inference结论一致——硬件因素在fine-tuning中同样可忽略。\n      training过程中的gradient accumulation引入了额外的数值非确定性(cuDNN autotuning,\n      nondeterministic reduction)，但binary scoring下这些差异仍不足以翻转大多数items。\n\n      inference vs fine-tuning的对比是一个独立发现：同一个evaluation framework(G-theory)\n      揭示了两种根本不同的方差regime——inference是\"measurement-dominated\"(item_id主导)，\n      fine-tuning是\"training-dominated\"(seed×lr主导)。这意味着reproducibility recipes\n      必须区分这两种使用场景。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 15: Inference vs fine-tuning variance decomposition\"\n        structure: \"Left columns=inference sources + %; Right columns=fine-tuning sources + %. Rows sorted by descending % within each column.\"\n        highlight: \"inference: item_id 60.4% #1; fine-tuning: seed×lr 28.4% #1, item_id 31.7% #2. Regime change.\"\n      - title: \"Supplementary Table S2: Fine-tuning variance by NLU task\"\n        structure: \"Rows=variance sources; Columns=SST-2, MNLI, RTE, COPA, Mean\"\n        highlight: \"item_id: SST-2 24.8 (easiest) → RTE 38.2 (hardest); seed×lr inversely related\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure (supplementary): Side-by-side stacked bars — inference(left, item_id=60% blue dominant)\n        vs fine-tuning(right, seed×lr=28% red + item_id=32% blue co-dominant).\n        Visual regime change immediately apparent. Arrow annotation: \"training-time variance sources\n        emerge and compete with item selection.\"\n    analysis: >\n      (1) 432 fine-tuning runs per task: for each (seed, lr, shuffle, gpu, precision) combination,\n      train RoBERTa-large for 3 epochs, evaluate on test set, collect item-level binary predictions；\n      (2) G-study with facets: seed, lr, data_shuffle, gpu, precision, item；\n      (3) Cross-task comparison of variance hierarchies；\n      (4) Formal comparison with inference results: test whether rank-order of sources differs\n      (Friedman test on component ranks, inference vs fine-tuning).\n      限制：仅encoder-only classification。decoder fine-tuning(LoRA on LLMs)需要\n      substantially更多compute，作为future work明确说明。\n\n  - name: \"LayerCast precision mitigation evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: >\n      在MMLU上测试LayerCast(FP16 storage + FP32 compute)作为第4个precision level,\n      量化这种mitigation策略对variance decomposition的影响。\n    expected_results:\n      total_new_records: 86400\n      layercast_accuracy: 0.709\n      layercast_vs_fp32_gap_pp: 0.3\n      layercast_vs_bf16_gap_pp: 0.2\n      precision_variance_reduction_pct: 65\n      precision_main_before: 1.4\n      precision_main_after: 0.5\n      precision_x_item_before: 2.8\n      precision_x_item_after: 1.0\n      other_components_change: \"<0.3pp on all non-precision sources\"\n      G_before: 0.618\n      G_after: 0.641\n      G_improvement: 0.023\n    result_rationale: >\n      LayerCast将precision方差降低65%的机制：LayerCast的混合精度(FP16存储+FP32计算)\n      在计算阶段维持了与纯FP32接近的数值精度，同时享受FP16的显存优势。\n      precision方差主要来自bf16/fp16/fp32之间的数值差异——LayerCast消除了\n      \"存储精度=计算精度\"的耦合，使其accuracy(70.9%)位于bf16(71.1%)和fp32(60.4%)\n      之间但非常接近bf16，表明FP32计算成功恢复了大部分精度。\n\n      precision×item从2.8%→1.0%的原因：没有LayerCast时，~15个\"边界items\"\n      (output logit差值<0.01)在不同precision下被翻转。LayerCast的FP32计算\n      使这些边界items的logit更精确，约10个不再翻转——但仍有~5个items因为\n      FP16权重的微小量化误差(mantissa截断)而保持翻转，贡献了剩余的1.0%。\n\n      G从0.618→0.641提升仅0.023因为precision×item只占总方差的2.8%——\n      消除大部分precision噪声只减少了分母中一个小组分，对G的提升有限。\n      这证实precision是一个real但不dominant的方差来源——值得mitigate但不是\n      提高reproducibility的primary lever(那是增加items)。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Supplementary Table S3: LayerCast impact on variance decomposition\"\n        structure: \"Rows=precision-related sources + G; Columns=3-precision (original), 4-precision (with LayerCast), delta\"\n        highlight: \"precision×item: 2.8→1.0 (↓64%); G: 0.618→0.641 (+0.023)\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      (1) 在exp-001 Llama design上增加LayerCast作为第4个precision条件\n      (1 model × 1 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 items)；\n      (2) 合并4个precision levels重新运行G-study；\n      (3) 比较3-precision和4-precision的decomposition，isolate LayerCast的影响；\n      (4) 定位LayerCast在practitioners的precision mitigation strategy中的价值。\n\n  - name: \"MATH benchmark — reasoning-heavy extension\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      MATH 200 items × 4 models × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps × 4 orderings.\n      测试chain-of-thought密集型任务的方差结构，扩展梯度至第5个benchmark。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 460800\n      single_model_item_id_pct: 22.1\n      prompt_x_item_pct: 13.5\n      seed_x_item_pct: 9.8\n      temp_x_item_pct: 14.2\n      precision_x_item_pct: 1.8\n      residual_pct: 24.6\n      other_and_small_interactions_pct: 14.0\n      single_model_G: 0.328\n      cross_model_model_x_item_pct: 24.8\n      cross_model_G: 0.035\n      d_study_items_G80: 1150\n      # --- Extended 5-benchmark gradient ---\n      extended_gradient_MMLU: 60.4\n      extended_gradient_HellaSwag: 50.4\n      extended_gradient_ARC: 42.1\n      extended_gradient_GSM8K: 28.3\n      extended_gradient_MATH: 22.1\n      extended_spread_pp: 38.3\n      extended_rank_correlation: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      MATH的item_id(22.1%)为全部benchmark最低的逐步解释：\n\n      MATH题目需要多步数学证明和推导(平均5-10步reasoning)，每一步都是一个\n      stochastic branching point——在T>0时，模型在每步可能选择不同的推理策略\n      (代数法 vs 几何法 vs 构造法)，而策略选择对不同item的影响截然不同。\n      这使得temperature×item=14.2%——MMLU(2.1%)的近7倍。物理机制：\n      MATH的chain-of-thought输出平均200-400 tokens，而MMLU只需选一个字母。\n      长输出中的sampling variance随token数累积(每个token的采样噪声叠加)，\n      使temperature的影响被系统性放大。\n\n      prompt×item=13.5%(MMLU的4.2倍)：MATH的few-shot exemplars不仅展示\n      答案格式，更展示\"如何推理\"。选择代数解法的exemplars会bias模型用代数思路，\n      选择图形推理的exemplars会bias模型画辅助线——不同推理策略在不同items上\n      效果差异巨大(代数法在方程题上强但在几何题上弱)，产生强prompt×item交互。\n\n      seed×item=9.8%反映了dropout和weight initialization在推理任务上的放大效应：\n      多步推理中，早期步骤的微小概率差异通过后续步骤被级联放大(error propagation)。\n\n      residual=24.6%高于其他benchmark因为MATH的chain-of-thought引入了大量\n      不可归因的随机变异——即使控制了所有设计facet，同一(model, precision, prompt,\n      seed, temperature, ordering)条件下的重复运行也因autoregressive sampling的\n      inherent stochasticity产生不同推理路径和不同结果。\n\n      G=0.328极低：当前200-item设计完全不可靠用于MATH评估。\n      D-study需要1150 items(MMLU的2.4倍)才达G≥0.80——这是chain-of-thought\n      引入的\"推理方差代价\"，对MATH/GPQA等reasoning benchmark有直接的实践意义。\n\n      model×item=24.8%(4模型)——4个benchmark中最高：不同模型的数学能力profile\n      差异极大(Qwen3可能擅长代数但弱于几何，Gemma反之)，导致model-specific的\n      item ranking在MATH上分歧最大。\n\n      5-benchmark梯度完美保持单调(rank corr=1.0)，spread扩至38.3pp(仍在[25,40]内)，\n      进一步强化核心叙事：方差结构沿knowledge→commonsense→science→arithmetic→proof\n      的认知复杂度轴系统性变化。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Supplementary Table S4: Extended 5-benchmark gradient\"\n        structure: \"Rows=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K, MATH; Columns=item_id%, prompt×item%, temp×item%, seed×item%, G, D-study items\"\n        highlight: \"item_id: 60.4→50.4→42.1→28.3→22.1; D-study: 480→550→650→900→1150\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Extended Figure 2 (5 bars): Five stacked bars MMLU→MATH. item_id wedge (blue)\n        progressively shrinks. prompt×item (orange) and temp×item (red) progressively grow.\n        Perfect visual gradient. MATH bar dominated by prompt×item+temp×item+residual,\n        with item_id as a minority component — stark contrast to MMLU.\n    analysis: >\n      (1) MATH evaluation需要specialized parsing: chain-of-thought output中提取final answer，\n      与gold answer做数学等价判定(symbolic equivalence, not string match)；\n      (2) 6 prompt templates设计为CoT strategy variants: zero-shot CoT, few-shot(algebra examples),\n      few-shot(geometry examples), few-shot(mixed), step-by-step, concise；\n      (3) 4 orderings不适用于MATH(开放生成)——替换为4组不同的few-shot exemplar sets；\n      (4) G-study + D-study与其他4个benchmark用identical pipeline处理；\n      (5) 更新跨benchmark梯度图至5个数据点，计算extended Spearman ρ。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14879,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14879},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"52656ab9-91b0-4a16-ba33-c6e3ee682184","uuid":"a119f743-4fc4-46ce-8316-c2f21370ef89"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":951492,"duration_api_ms":953419,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  4-model交叉分析完全验证2-model趋势：model×item=24.1%维持为第二大方差来源（MMLU），\n  跨模型G=0.065，D-study证明即使10模型G仅0.179——model×item是不可约的结构性障碍。\n  跨benchmark梯度完美单调：MMLU(60.4%)→HellaSwag(50.4%)→ARC-C(42.1%)→GSM8K(28.3%)，\n  秩相关=1.0，spread=32.1pp。\"方差结构本身是benchmark-conditional的\"叙事完全成立。\n  Claim 1升级为\"model-conditional item dominance is a fundamental, benchmark-modulated barrier\"。\n  Claim 2经多硬件确认separability（hardware×methodology=0.18%<0.5%）。\n  Claim 3的D-study预算表跨4benchmark揭示推理型benchmark可复现性成本为知识型的1.9倍\n  （GSM8K 900 items vs MMLU 480 items）。IRT vs G-theory 4.4×差距作为独立贡献。\n  全部9项MD防御通过。P0五实验全部按时完成。投稿AAAI，目标7.0+/10。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Full-scale 4-model MMLU precision study\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001\"\n    description: >\n      4 models (Qwen3-8B, Llama-3.1-8B, Gemma-2-9B, Mistral-7B) × 3 precisions\n      (Gemma仅bf16+fp32) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items.\n      V0 enforce_eager统一引擎消除float32混淆。核心：4模型交叉验证2模型的model×item交互。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 891200\n      models_completed: 4\n      per_model_accuracy_bf16:\n        llama: 0.711\n        gemma: 0.732\n        mistral: 0.685\n        qwen3: 0.748\n      single_model_item_id_pct_llama: 61.1\n      single_model_item_id_pct_gemma: 58.7\n      single_model_item_id_pct_mistral: 59.4\n      single_model_item_id_pct_qwen3: 62.3\n      single_model_item_id_pct_mean: 60.4\n      single_model_G_binary_mean: 0.618\n      cross_4model_item_id_pct: 36.8\n      cross_4model_model_pct: 8.3\n      cross_4model_model_x_item_pct: 24.1\n      cross_4model_precision_pct: 1.4\n      cross_4model_prompt_x_item_pct: 3.2\n      cross_4model_seed_x_item_pct: 3.1\n      cross_4model_temp_x_item_pct: 2.1\n      cross_4model_prec_x_item_pct: 1.8\n      cross_4model_ordering_x_item_pct: 0.3\n      cross_4model_infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.08\n      cross_4model_residual_pct: 18.8\n      cross_model_G_4model: 0.065\n      d_study_10models_G: 0.179\n      d_study_items_G80_practical: 480\n      d_study_items_G80_all_random: 540\n    result_rationale: >\n      model×item从2模型26.2%略降至4模型24.1%：增加Mistral和Qwen3扩大了模型多样性\n      （Llama/Mistral=相似decoder架构，Gemma=独特norm结构，Qwen3=GQA+SwiGLU变体），\n      但4模型的averaging效应会平滑个别模型对之间的极端分歧——2模型时Llama-Gemma的\n      item difficulty rank disagreement被完全捕获，4模型时某些model-pair间的agreement\n      部分抵消了其他pair的disagreement，导致总model×item略低。但24.1%仍远高于任何\n      其他非item来源，确认model×item是系统性的而非2-model noise。\n\n      单模型item_id维持55-65%因为200-item MMLU的分层抽样覆盖STEM/humanities/social/other，\n      学科间难度跨度大(STEM>60%错误率 vs social<30%)，这种异质性在任何单模型下都表现为\n      高item方差。Qwen3最高(62.3%)因为其accuracy最高(74.8%)，high-accuracy模型的item\n      responses更趋向两极化(更多items被稳定地答对或答错)，增大了item间方差。\n\n      跨模型G=0.065：4模型引入更多model×item来源，G从0.073(2模型)降至0.065。\n      D-study投影10模型G=0.179证明model×item不可通过增加模型数量来消除——\n      这是模型架构和训练数据差异导致的item difficulty系统性重排，不是采样噪声。\n\n      infra×method<0.1%(binary)：V0 enforce_eager消除了引擎混淆，二值评分下\n      精度差异主要影响绝对水平，不产生precision×prompt或precision×seed的交互。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 1: Single-model variance decomposition (binary, MMLU, 4 models)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=variance sources (item_id, precision, prompt×item, seed×item, temp×item, prec×item, ordering×item, residual); Columns=Llama, Gemma, Mistral, Qwen3, Mean\"\n        highlight: \"item_id: 61.1, 58.7, 59.4, 62.3, mean=60.4%; residual: 21.6, 22.4, 21.9, 20.8\"\n      - title: \"Table 2: Cross-model 4-way variance decomposition (binary, MMLU)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=variance sources incl. model, model×item; Columns=% variance, bootstrap 95% CI, significance\"\n        highlight: \"model×item: 24.1% [21.3, 27.0] p<0.001; item_id: 36.8% [33.5, 40.2]; model: 8.3% [5.1, 12.4]\"\n      - title: \"Table 3: G-coefficient comparison — single vs cross-model\"\n        structure: \"Rows=Llama, Gemma, Mistral, Qwen3, 2-model cross, 4-model cross; Columns=G(binary), G(text), items for G≥0.80\"\n        highlight: \"G collapse: single mean 0.618 → 4-model cross 0.065; D-study 10-model G=0.179\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure 1 (reveal figure): Paired stacked bars. Left bar=single-model mean decomposition\n        (item_id=60.4% dominates). Right bar=4-model cross decomposition (item_id shrinks to 36.8%,\n        model×item=24.1% appears as large new wedge, model=8.3%). Annotated arrows show\n        item_id↓23.6pp and model×item emergence. G value labels (0.618→0.065) at top.\n    analysis: >\n      分析流程：(1) 4模型分别运行5-facet G-study(prec×prompt×seed×temp×ordering×item)，\n      确认item_id在55-65%；(2) 合并数据，model作为crossed random facet运行6-facet G-study，\n      使用bf16+fp32平衡子集(Gemma限制)；(3) D-study投影：固定prec+temp后，items 100→2000，\n      绘制G曲线；(4) 与2-model结果对比。Gemma仅有bf16+fp32，跨模型分析使用2-precision平衡子集。\n\n  - name: \"Item resampling stability test\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001b\"\n    description: >\n      3组独立分层200-item MMLU样本(seeds 0,7,99) × Llama × 3 prec × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings\n      = 54 conditions/sample × 200 items = 10,800 records/sample。验证item dominance非抽样伪影。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 32400\n      records_per_sample: 10800\n      conditions_per_sample: 54\n      item_id_sample_seed0: 57.8\n      item_id_sample_seed7: 62.5\n      item_id_sample_seed99: 60.1\n      item_id_mean: 60.13\n      item_id_sd: 2.37\n      resampling_item_id_cv: 0.039\n      G_sample_seed0: 0.594\n      G_sample_seed7: 0.631\n      G_sample_seed99: 0.612\n      G_mean: 0.612\n      G_cv: 0.030\n      variance_rank_order_preserved: true\n      prompt_x_item_cv: 0.061\n      seed_x_item_cv: 0.073\n      residual_cv: 0.044\n    result_rationale: >\n      CV=0.039(远低于15%阈值)的原因：MMLU分层抽样确保每组200 items按学科比例分配\n      (STEM/humanities/social/other各~50题)。item dominance主要源于两层异质性：\n      (1)学科间——STEM题目系统性更难(平均accuracy ~55%)vs social science(~78%)，\n      这个学科间差异在任何分层样本中都被保留；\n      (2)学科内——同一学科的知识点覆盖面广(abstract_algebra vs high_school_math)，\n      不同知识点的难度差异在充分大的样本(200题)中被稳定采样。\n\n      样本间波动(57.8%-62.5%)的来源：seed7恰好抽到了更多高区分度items\n      (如advanced mathematics中的证明题和abstract algebra)，这些items的accuracy\n      跨条件变异更大，推高item_id。seed0抽到的items difficulty分布更均匀(中等难度居多)，\n      item间差异较小，item_id略低。但这5pp的波动相对于60%的基线是trivial的。\n\n      G系数的CV(0.030)甚至低于item_id的CV，因为G是item_id的归一化函数——\n      分子(signal=item variance)和分母(total variance)同方向波动，比值更稳定。\n\n      所有variance sources的rank order在3组间完全一致\n      (item_id>>residual>prompt×item≈seed×item>其他)，\n      证明方差结构是MMLU的内在属性而非特定200-item样本的伪影。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 4: Resampling stability — variance decomposition across 3 item draws\"\n        structure: \"Rows=item_id, prompt×item, seed×item, prec×item, residual, other; Columns=Sample A(s0), B(s7), C(s99), Mean, SD, CV\"\n        highlight: \"item_id: 57.8/62.5/60.1, CV=0.039; rank order identical across all 3 samples\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Supplementary: Three stacked bars (one per sample), nearly identical structure.\n        Bootstrap 95% CIs shown as whiskers, overlapping across all samples.\n        Dashed horizontal line at sample mean for item_id.\n    analysis: >\n      (1) 用3个不同random seeds对MMLU 14K items进行分层抽样(按57个subject等比例)；\n      (2) 每组200 items × 54 conditions运行完整G-study；\n      (3) 计算每个variance component的cross-sample CV和rank order一致性；\n      (4) Friedman检验确认rank order无显著差异(p>0.10)。\n\n  - name: \"Multi-benchmark cross-task replication\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16; Gemma用BF16/FP32) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds ×\n      2 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 items on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag.\n      核心实验：建立跨benchmark方差梯度。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 1382400\n      records_per_benchmark: 460800\n      # --- HellaSwag (commonsense) ---\n      hellaswag_single_model_item_id_pct: 50.4\n      hellaswag_prompt_x_item_pct: 5.4\n      hellaswag_seed_x_item_pct: 4.9\n      hellaswag_temp_x_item_pct: 5.2\n      hellaswag_residual_pct: 21.3\n      hellaswag_cross_model_item_id_pct: 33.2\n      hellaswag_model_x_item_pct: 21.3\n      hellaswag_model_pct: 8.7\n      hellaswag_cross_model_G: 0.058\n      hellaswag_single_model_G: 0.548\n      hellaswag_d_study_items_G80: 550\n      # --- ARC-Challenge (science reasoning) ---\n      arc_single_model_item_id_pct: 42.1\n      arc_prompt_x_item_pct: 7.3\n      arc_seed_x_item_pct: 5.8\n      arc_temp_x_item_pct: 6.5\n      arc_model_pct: 9.8\n      arc_residual_pct: 20.5\n      arc_cross_model_item_id_pct: 27.4\n      arc_model_x_item_pct: 22.7\n      arc_cross_model_G: 0.052\n      arc_single_model_G: 0.495\n      arc_d_study_items_G80: 650\n      # --- GSM8K (math reasoning) ---\n      gsm8k_single_model_item_id_pct: 28.3\n      gsm8k_prompt_x_item_pct: 11.8\n      gsm8k_seed_x_item_pct: 8.2\n      gsm8k_temp_x_item_pct: 9.4\n      gsm8k_model_pct: 12.4\n      gsm8k_residual_pct: 18.2\n      gsm8k_cross_model_item_id_pct: 16.5\n      gsm8k_model_x_item_pct: 23.5\n      gsm8k_cross_model_G: 0.041\n      gsm8k_single_model_G: 0.385\n      gsm8k_d_study_items_G80: 900\n      # --- Cross-benchmark gradient ---\n      gradient_item_id_MMLU: 60.4\n      gradient_item_id_HellaSwag: 50.4\n      gradient_item_id_ARC: 42.1\n      gradient_item_id_GSM8K: 28.3\n      gradient_spread_pp: 32.1\n      gradient_rank_correlation: 1.0\n      model_x_item_range: \"21.3-24.1% across all benchmarks\"\n      cross_model_G_range: \"0.041-0.065 across all benchmarks\"\n      separability_binary_all_lt_0_5pct: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      跨benchmark梯度单调递减的逐级机制解释：\n\n      MMLU(知识检索, item_id=60.4%): 题目考察封闭式事实(如\"RNA聚合酶的功能\")。\n      item difficulty取决于知识点的稀有程度和训练数据覆盖，这对同一模型的不同\n      prompt/seed/temperature非常稳定——模型要么在训练语料中见过这个fact，要么没有。\n      改变prompt措辞(\"Answer the following\"→\"Select the correct option\")不会让模型\n      突然\"知道\"之前不知道的知识。temperature的影响也小——T=0.0和T=0.3下，\n      知识检索的top token概率通常>0.9，sampling几乎不改变结果。因此item_id占主导60%+。\n\n      HellaSwag(常识推理, item_id=50.4%, ↓10pp): 题目要求基于日常场景选择合理的continuation。\n      item difficulty仍有较强结构(某些场景本质上更容易判断，如\"厨师拿起刀→开始切菜\"\n      vs 模糊场景)，但prompt措辞开始影响模型对场景的\"理解角度\"——不同prompt可能\n      引导模型关注不同的context cue，导致prompt×item从MMLU的3.2%升至5.4%。\n      temperature的影响也增大(5.2% vs 2.1%)因为常识推理的答案概率分布更平坦(top token\n      概率~0.6-0.8)，sampling噪声有更大机会翻转结果。\n\n      ARC-Challenge(科学推理, item_id=42.1%, ↓8pp): 题目需要多步科学推理\n      (如\"如果地球轴倾斜增大，对季节有什么影响→更极端\")。推理路径的选择更依赖\n      prompt引导——few-shot示例的推理风格会bias模型的reasoning approach，\n      prompt×item升至7.3%。seed×item=5.8%反映了多步推理中采样分支点的影响。\n      model间的科学推理能力差异更显著(model=9.8% vs MMLU 8.3%)——\n      有些模型(Qwen3)在STEM训练上投入更多，而有些(Mistral)偏向语言任务。\n\n      GSM8K(数学推理, item_id=28.3%, ↓14pp): 多步算术(平均4-6步)使每一步成为随机分支点。\n      temperature直接控制chain-of-thought的随机性(temp×item=9.4%, MMLU的4.5倍)——\n      T=0.7时同一题可能生成完全不同的解题路径，有的正确有的错误。\n      prompt格式影响极大(prompt×item=11.8%)：few-shot示例中的解题格式\n      (\"Let's think step by step\" vs \"Solution:\" vs 无CoT)直接决定模型是否使用\n      chain-of-thought，对不同难度的item影响截然不同——简单加减题不需要CoT也能对，\n      但复杂分数题没有CoT就会失败。seed×item=8.2%因为多步生成过程中的\n      cumulative sampling variance在长输出中被放大。\n\n      model×item在所有benchmark维持20-24%的原因：不同模型的训练数据和架构差异\n      导致model-specific的知识和能力profile——Qwen3可能在数学上强但常识弱，\n      Gemma可能科学推理强但数学弱。这种model-specific的item ranking在所有task type上\n      都产生显著交互，而且不随benchmark类型系统性变化——它是模型多样性的反映而非\n      task type的函数。\n\n      D-study预算梯度(MMLU 480→GSM8K 900 items)的解释：\n      推理型benchmark的非item方差(prompt×item + temp×item + seed×item)合计\n      从MMLU的~9%增至GSM8K的~29%。要在这些额外噪声源存在的情况下仍达到G≥0.80，\n      需要更多items来提高signal-to-noise ratio。GSM8K需要近2倍于MMLU的items，\n      揭示\"推理型benchmark的可复现性成本远高于知识型\"——这是一个有直接实践意义的发现。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 5: Cross-benchmark single-model variance decomposition (binary)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=item_id, prompt×item, seed×item, temp×item, prec×item, ordering×item, residual, other; Columns=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K\"\n        highlight: \"item_id: 60.4→50.4→42.1→28.3 (monotonic ↓); prompt×item: 3.2→5.4→7.3→11.8 (monotonic ↑); temp×item: 2.1→5.2→6.5→9.4 (monotonic ↑)\"\n      - title: \"Table 6: Cross-model (4-model) decomposition per benchmark\"\n        structure: \"Rows=benchmark; Columns=item_id%, model%, model×item%, cross-model G, D-study items G≥0.80\"\n        highlight: \"model×item: MMLU 24.1, HellaSwag 21.3, ARC 22.7, GSM8K 23.5 — all ≥20%\"\n      - title: \"Table 7: Benchmark-specific D-study reproducibility budgets\"\n        structure: \"Rows=benchmark; Columns=items(practical), prompts, seeds, total conditions, est. GPU-hours per model\"\n        highlight: \"MMLU: 480 items × 3 prompts × 4 seeds; GSM8K: 900 items × 4 prompts × 6 seeds\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure 2 (gradient figure, core novel finding): Four stacked bars arranged\n        MMLU→HellaSwag→ARC→GSM8K. item_id wedge visually shrinks left→right (blue).\n        prompt×item (orange) and temp×item (red) wedges grow. Monotonic gradient\n        immediately visible. Bracket annotations show spread=32.1pp. Spearman ρ=1.0 labeled.\n      - >\n        Figure 3 (D-study budget comparison): Four D-study curves (G vs items),\n        one per benchmark. MMLU reaches G=0.80 first (~480 items), GSM8K last (~900 items).\n        Horizontal dashed lines at G=0.70 and G=0.80. Shaded region below G=0.80 labeled\n        \"unreliable zone.\" Inset shows current practice (200 items) falls below 0.80 for all benchmarks.\n    analysis: >\n      (1) 每个benchmark的6 prompt templates需要benchmark-specific设计(GSM8K用CoT variants,\n      ARC用science reasoning templates, HellaSwag用completion templates)；\n      (2) 4 ordering rotations: ABCD→BCDA→CDAB→DABC for MC benchmarks; GSM8K无ordering facet\n      (开放式生成)，用4个不同的few-shot exemplar sets替代；\n      (3) 分别对每个benchmark运行single-model和4-model G-study；\n      (4) 计算跨benchmark Spearman ρ(item_id排序 vs 先验reasoning complexity排序)；\n      (5) 对每个benchmark运行D-study grid search(items×prompts×seeds)找G≥0.80最优配置。\n\n  - name: \"Multi-hardware separability G-study\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      4 models × 2 GPU types × 2 precisions (BF16, FP16/FP32) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds ×\n      3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items. Claim 2核心实验：\n      测试hardware×methodology交互，证明基础设施和方法论因素可分离。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records_analyzed: 1382400\n      new_records_gpu2: 691200\n      gpu_types: [\"RTX PRO 6000 (Blackwell)\", \"TBD second GPU\"]\n      gpu_type_main_effect_pct: 0.12\n      hardware_x_methodology_binary_pct: 0.18\n      hardware_x_prompt_pct: 0.05\n      hardware_x_seed_pct: 0.02\n      hardware_x_temperature_binary_pct: 0.04\n      hardware_x_ordering_pct: 0.07\n      hardware_x_item_pct: 1.2\n      precision_x_hardware_pct: 0.35\n      hardware_x_temperature_text_pct: 0.83\n      separability_confirmed_binary: true\n      item_id_with_hardware: 59.8\n      variance_structure_consistent_with_exp001: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      hardware×methodology=0.18%(binary)的物理解释：两种GPU微架构(如Blackwell vs Ampere)\n      的浮点运算单元实现不同——Tensor Core的矩阵乘法顺序、warp-level reduction的\n      累加顺序都不同。但在BF16/FP16下，这些数值差异只影响最后1-2 bits of mantissa。\n      对于binary scoring，一个item的正确/错误判定取决于top token概率是否最高——\n      只有当两个选项的概率差<0.001时，GPU差异才可能翻转结果。这种\"边界item\"在200题中\n      约3-5题，且它们与prompt/seed的交互在统计上不可与noise区分，因此\n      hardware×prompt和hardware×seed都<0.1%。\n\n      hardware×item=1.2%高于hardware×methodology的原因：这1.2%来自那些确实被\n      GPU差异翻转的边界items——它们的翻转是item-specific的(取决于item的概率分布形状)，\n      而非methodology-specific的。这是item-conditional的hardware效应，\n      不违反separability——separability关注的是hardware是否调节methodology的效应，\n      而hardware×item只说明hardware的效应是item-dependent的(符合预期)。\n\n      text_exact_match下hardware×temperature=0.83%：文本精确匹配对生成过程中的\n      任何微小概率差异都敏感(不同token选择→不同字符串→match失败)。\n      temperature放大了GPU数值差异的影响——T=0.7时sampling distribution更平坦，\n      GPU间mantissa差异更有可能改变sampled token。但0.83%仍<1%，\n      与Messina & Scotta (2026)的FP非结合性理论预测量级一致。\n\n      整体方差结构与exp-001一致(item_id=59.8% vs 60.4%)，\n      hardware facet仅\"吸收\"了0.6pp的原属residual的方差，\n      证明单GPU实验的结论不因hardware选择而改变。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 8: Hardware-crossed variance decomposition (binary, MMLU, 4 models × 2 GPUs)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=all sources including 6 hardware interaction terms; Columns=% variance, 95% CI, significant?\"\n        highlight: \"hardware: 0.12% [0.02,0.31]; hw×method(aggregate): 0.18% [0.03,0.42]; hw×item: 1.2% [0.7,1.8]\"\n      - title: \"Table 9: Metric-conditional separability test\"\n        structure: \"Rows=hardware interaction terms; Columns=binary %, text_exact_match %, difference\"\n        highlight: \"hw×temp: binary 0.04% vs text 0.83%; separability is metric-conditional\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Supplementary: Heatmap of all infrastructure×methodology interaction terms\n        (rows=infra factors, cols=method factors). Binary panel: all cells <0.5% (cool colors).\n        Text panel: hw×temp cell at 0.83% (warm spot). Diagonal of hardware×item\n        shown separately at 1.2%.\n    analysis: >\n      (1) 在第2种GPU上运行与exp-001匹配的设计(4模型 × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings)；\n      (2) 合并两GPU数据，hardware作为crossed facet运行G-study；\n      (3) 分别提取所有hardware×methodology和hardware×item交互项；\n      (4) binary和text_exact_match分别分析；\n      (5) bootstrap CI检验每个hardware交互项是否显著异于0。\n\n  - name: \"Comprehensive combined analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: >\n      对exp-001/001b/002/003的全部数据进行17项系统分析(a-q)。纯分析实验(0 GPU hours)。\n      涵盖model-as-facet、bootstrap CIs、IRT对比、全部9项MD防御、power analysis、\n      practitioner toolkit生成。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records_analyzed: 4288000\n      # --- (a) Model-as-facet (covered in exp-001 results above) ---\n      # --- (b) Bootstrap CIs ---\n      bootstrap_resamples: 1000\n      ci_model_x_item_95: [21.3, 27.0]\n      ci_item_id_95: [33.5, 40.2]\n      ci_cross_model_G_95: [0.048, 0.083]\n      all_key_cis_exclude_zero: true\n      # --- (c) D-study with CIs ---\n      d_study_items_G80_practical_ci: [445, 520]\n      d_study_items_G80_all_random_ci: [495, 590]\n      # --- (d) REML vs Henderson ---\n      reml_vs_henderson_max_diff_pct: 1.4\n      reml_vs_henderson_rank_preserved: true\n      # --- (e) Logprob scoring ---\n      logprob_item_id_pct_mmlu: 53.2\n      logprob_G_mmlu: 0.572\n      logprob_vs_binary_rank_correlation: 0.94\n      # --- (f) Ranking stability ---\n      precision_x_temp_alters_model_ranking: false\n      kendall_tau_across_conditions: 0.94\n      # --- (g) Higher-order interactions ---\n      higher_order_total_pct: 3.2\n      largest_3way: \"prec×temp×item = 1.1%\"\n      # --- (h) IRT vs G-theory ---\n      irt_mmlu_items: 116\n      gtheory_mmlu_items: 510\n      irt_gtheory_ratio_mmlu: 4.40\n      irt_gtheory_ratio_hellaswag: 4.20\n      irt_gtheory_ratio_arc: 4.35\n      irt_gtheory_ratio_gsm8k: 4.65\n      irt_gtheory_ratio_mean: 4.40\n      gtheory_G_at_irt_recommendation: 0.529\n      # --- (i) Power analysis ---\n      power_5pct_interaction: 0.998\n      min_detectable_interaction_80pct_power: 1.2\n      # --- (k) Fixed vs random sensitivity (MD2) ---\n      fixed_vs_random_item_id_change_pct: 2.8\n      fixed_vs_random_G_change: 0.032\n      # --- (l) Binary data defense (MD1) ---\n      bernoulli_observed_correlation: 0.68\n      null_simulation_item_id_pct: 0.09\n      observed_over_null_ratio: 671\n      # --- (m) Bootstrap vs jackknife (MD6) ---\n      bootstrap_jackknife_ci_width_ratio_range: [0.96, 1.04]\n      # --- (n) 2×2 vs 3×3 sensitivity (MD8) ---\n      mmlu_2x2_vs_3x3_item_id_diff_pct: 3.6\n      # --- (o) G at full MMLU (MD5) ---\n      g_at_14k_mmlu_items: 0.943\n      # --- (p) Logprob across benchmarks (MD9) ---\n      logprob_item_id_gradient: \"MMLU 53.2→HellaSwag 44.1→ARC 37.8→GSM8K 24.6\"\n      # --- (q) GPU cost ---\n      gpu_hours_mmlu_G80_per_model: 48\n      gpu_hours_gsm8k_G80_per_model: 135\n      # --- Practitioner protocol ---\n      recommended_min_prompts: 3\n      recommended_min_seeds: 4\n      recommended_temperature: 0.0\n      recommended_min_items_knowledge: 480\n      recommended_min_items_reasoning: 900\n    result_rationale: >\n      IRT vs G-theory 4.4×差距的机制：\n      IRT(Rasch/2PL)将response建模为θ_person和b_item的函数，所有非item因素\n      (prompt, seed, ordering)被折入error term。因此IRT的\"reliable measurement\"\n      只要求item difficulty参数估计稳定——116 items足以稳定估计200个difficulty参数\n      (Rasch的渐近效率在~100 items时充分)。\n      G-theory将prompt×item(4.6%), seed×item(4.7%), ordering×item等作为系统性方差分离出来，\n      G系数的分母包含这些维度的方差。要在同时考虑prompt/seed/ordering变异的情况下\n      仍达到G≥0.80，需要510 items——额外的394 items用于\"吸收\"IRT忽略的非item噪声。\n      在IRT推荐的116 items处，G-theory G仅0.529——这就是\"多facet reliability的代价\"。\n\n      GSM8K的ratio(4.65×)高于MMLU(4.40×)因为数学任务的prompt/seed/temperature方差更大，\n      G-theory需要吸收的额外噪声更多，而IRT仍只看item discrimination(GSM8K items的\n      discrimination通常更高——数学题更能区分能力，因此IRT需要的items反而更少)。\n\n      bootstrap CI [21.3, 27.0] on model×item不含0的原因：4模型×200 items的设计\n      每个model×item cell有864个重复(6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 2 prec × 2 GPU)，\n      power分析显示对≥1.2% interaction effect的检测power>0.80，\n      对≥5% effect的power>0.998。24.1%的效应量远超检测阈值。\n\n      fixed vs random sensitivity仅2.8%变化(MD2)：temperature虽只有3个设计点，\n      但在G-theory中fixed/random的区别仅影响temperature方差是否进入G系数分母。\n      temperature main effect<2%，fixed→random只增加分母~2%→item_id%变化2.8%。\n      这证明即使temperature不满足\"从universe随机抽样\"的理想假设，结论仍稳健。\n\n      binary data defense(MD1): r(Bernoulli p(1-p), observed)=0.68表明~46%的item\n      variance可归因于Bernoulli机制(difficulty p决定p(1-p))，但null simulation\n      (random p_i ~ Uniform, item_id=0.09%)证明仅Bernoulli机制不产生我们观察到的\n      61%方差——实际值是null的671倍。另外54%的\"超Bernoulli\"item variance反映了\n      items间真实的知识点差异和cognitive demand差异。\n\n      G at 14K items=0.943(MD5)：D-study投影f(n_items)是log-concave的，\n      200→14K items的G提升(0.618→0.943)证明完整MMLU的reliability远高于\n      200-item子集。我们的发现是\"子抽样的成本\"而非\"MMLU本身不可靠\"。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 10: IRT vs G-theory item requirements (4 benchmarks)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K; Columns=IRT items, G-theory items, ratio, G-theory G at IRT items, extra sources\"\n        highlight: \"MMLU: 116 vs 510 (4.4×), G=0.529 at 116; GSM8K: 82 vs 381 (4.65×)\"\n      - title: \"Table 11: Bootstrap 95% CIs on variance components (MMLU, 4-model cross)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=all variance sources; Columns=point %, lower CI, upper CI, excludes 0?\"\n        highlight: \"model×item [21.3,27.0] excludes 0 ✓; infra×method [0.0,0.42] includes 0 ✓\"\n      - title: \"Table 12: Methodological defense summary (MD1-MD9)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=MD1 binary data through MD9 title alignment; Columns=test, threshold, result, verdict\"\n        highlight: \"All 9 defenses pass: MD1 671× null, MD2 <5% change, MD3 qualified, MD4 monotonic, MD5 0.943, MD6 ratio 0.96-1.04, MD7 4.4× ratio, MD8 <5% change, MD9 logprob expanded\"\n      - title: \"Table 13: Benchmark-specific D-study reproducibility budget (G≥0.80)\"\n        structure: \"Rows=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K; Columns=items, prompts, seeds, total conditions, est. GPU-hours, comparison to current practice\"\n        highlight: \"MMLU 480×3×4, GSM8K 900×4×6; current practice (200×1×1) yields G=0.385-0.618\"\n      - title: \"Table 14: GPU cost estimates for recommended budgets\"\n        structure: \"Rows=benchmark; Columns=items, prompts, seeds, hours/model (8B), hours/model (14B)\"\n        highlight: \"MMLU ~48h, GSM8K ~135h (8B model on single GPU)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure 4 (IRT vs G-theory): Stacked bar pair per benchmark. Left bar (IRT, narrow):\n        116 items single color. Right bar (G-theory, wide): 510 items stacked—base 116 items\n        (same color as IRT), extra items partitioned into prompt×item portion (orange),\n        seed×item portion (green), residual portion (gray). Visual immediately shows\n        \"where the extra items go.\"\n      - >\n        Figure 5 (temperature×metric heatmap): 2 rows (binary, text_exact_match) × 3 columns\n        (T=0.0, T=0.3, T=0.7). Cell color=G value. Binary row: gradual degradation\n        0.760→0.624→0.549. Text row: 0.058→0.011→0.007 (near-zero across all T>0).\n        Stark contrast between rows.\n    analysis: >\n      17项分析按依赖关系分3波执行：\n      Wave 1 (独立，可并行): bootstrap CIs(b), jackknife CIs(m), fixed/random(k),\n      binary defense(l), REML vs Henderson(d), 2×2 vs 3×3(n), power(i), logprob(e,p).\n      Wave 2 (需Wave 1 CIs): model-as-facet final(a), D-study with CIs(c),\n      higher-order(g), ranking stability(f).\n      Wave 3 (需全部benchmark数据): IRT comparison(h), cross-benchmark budget(j,q),\n      G@14K(o), practitioner protocol(j).\n\n  - name: \"14B model scale extension\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B在datacenter GPU上运行BF16/FP16 × MMLU 200 items。\n      测试模型规模(8B→14B)和架构(dense vs reasoning-distilled)对方差层级的影响。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 345600\n      qwen3_14b_accuracy_bf16: 0.792\n      deepseek_r1_14b_accuracy_bf16: 0.803\n      qwen3_14b_item_id_pct: 63.8\n      deepseek_r1_14b_item_id_pct: 61.2\n      scale_14b_item_id_mean: 62.5\n      scale_8b_item_id_mean: 60.4\n      scale_delta_pp: 2.1\n      scale_delta_significant: false\n      single_model_G_14b_mean: 0.642\n      cross_model_2x14b_model_x_item_pct: 22.4\n      variance_hierarchy_preserved: true\n      prompt_x_item_14b_mean: 3.8\n      seed_x_item_14b_mean: 4.1\n      residual_14b_mean: 19.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      14B模型item_id略高于8B(62.5% vs 60.4%, +2.1pp，不显著)的原因：\n      14B模型的知识覆盖更广(训练参数多50-75%)，使得item difficulty的\"已知/未知\"\n      二分更加清晰——更多items被稳定答对(高置信度)或仍然稳定答错(超出能力范围)，\n      item间的正确率差异(variance)更大。但增幅很小因为MMLU的difficulty分布跨度大，\n      即使14B模型也在高难度STEM题上系统性失败(如abstract_algebra正确率<30%)。\n\n      方差层级完全保持(item_id>>prompt×item≈seed×item>residual>其他)的原因：\n      方差decomposition的结构主要取决于experimental design(多少个prompt, seed, item)\n      和benchmark的内在特性(知识vs推理)，而非模型能力水平。更强的模型只是\n      右移了accuracy分布，但各facet的相对贡献不变——prompt×item反映的是prompt\n      措辞与item知识点的交互，这种交互在8B和14B上都存在且比例相似。\n\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B(reasoning distillation)在MMLU上不改变方差结构，\n      因为MMLU主要考察知识而非推理——reasoning distillation优化的是chain-of-thought\n      推理能力，但MMLU的MC选择不需要长推理链。R1-Distill的影响在GSM8K/MATH上\n      会更显著(作为future work的motivation)。\n\n      cross-model model×item=22.4%(2个14B模型)仍>20%，证明model×item交互\n      不随scale减弱——即使是更大更强的模型，它们之间的item-level disagreement\n      仍然substantial。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Supplementary Table S1: 8B vs 14B variance decomposition comparison\"\n        structure: \"Rows=variance sources; Columns=8B mean(4 models), Qwen3-14B, DeepSeek-R1-14B, 14B mean\"\n        highlight: \"item_id: 60.4(8B) vs 63.8/61.2(14B); hierarchy rank identical\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Supplementary figure: Overlay of 8B(semi-transparent) and 14B stacked bars.\n        Structures nearly identical. Annotation: \"scale does not qualitatively alter\n        variance hierarchy.\"\n    analysis: >\n      (1) 在datacenter GPU上运行标准design(与exp-001 Llama配置一致)；\n      (2) paired comparison: 计算每个variance component的8B→14B delta及bootstrap CI；\n      (3) 如果所有delta的CI含0→结论：scale是二阶调节因素。\n      注意：14B需要≥48GB VRAM，可能需要tensor parallelism，这本身引入了额外的\n      数值非确定性(跨GPU通信的reduce顺序不同)，需要作为limitation讨论。\n\n  - name: \"Fine-tuning G-study (RoBERTa-large)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA: 6 seeds × 3 learning rates × 4 data shuffles\n      × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1,728 total fine-tuning runs.\n      测试inference vs fine-tuning的方差层级是否存在质变。\n    expected_results:\n      total_fine_tuning_runs: 1728\n      runs_per_task: 432\n      # --- Averaged across 4 tasks ---\n      ft_seed_x_lr_pct: 28.4\n      ft_item_id_pct: 31.7\n      ft_data_shuffle_x_item_pct: 12.3\n      ft_lr_main_pct: 8.9\n      ft_seed_main_pct: 6.2\n      ft_gpu_x_precision_pct: 0.4\n      ft_residual_pct: 12.1\n      ft_G_mean: 0.487\n      # --- Per-task breakdown ---\n      ft_item_id_sst2: 24.8\n      ft_item_id_mnli: 33.5\n      ft_item_id_rte: 38.2\n      ft_item_id_copa: 30.4\n      ft_seed_x_lr_sst2: 32.1\n      ft_seed_x_lr_mnli: 25.8\n      ft_seed_x_lr_rte: 26.4\n      ft_seed_x_lr_copa: 29.2\n      key_finding: \"Variance hierarchy qualitatively differs: fine-tuning is seed×lr-dominated; inference is item-dominated\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fine-tuning与inference方差结构的质变解释：\n\n      inference中方差来源仅限于evaluation-time因素——模型参数固定，变异只来自\n      \"如何问\"(prompt, ordering)和\"问什么\"(item)，因此item_id主导(60%+)。\n\n      fine-tuning引入training-time方差源，彻底改变了方差层级：\n      (1) seed×lr=28.4%成为最大来源：random seed决定参数初始化和dropout mask，\n      learning rate决定优化轨迹的aggressive程度。seed和lr的交互极强因为：\n      不同初始化在不同lr下可能converge到loss landscape的不同local minima，\n      产生的decision boundary在specific items上有系统性差异。\n      高lr+某些seed组合可能skip过optimal basin导致特定item类型的性能退化。\n\n      (2) item_id降至31.7%：fine-tuned RoBERTa在SST-2/MNLI上accuracy>90%，\n      大多数items被所有模型变体正确分类——item间difficulty差异被compression到\n      narrow range(90-99% correct)。相比inference时60-80%的accuracy范围，\n      fine-tuning后item间variance空间更小，因此item_id的相对占比下降。\n      SST-2的item_id最低(24.8%)因为task最简单(accuracy~94%)，items间差异最小。\n      RTE的item_id最高(38.2%)因为task最难(accuracy~72%)，items间差异更大。\n\n      (3) data_shuffle×item=12.3%：training examples的呈现顺序影响哪些patterns\n      被\"最后学到\"(recency effect)。由于catastrophic forgetting，后见examples的\n      patterns被更好地记住——不同shuffle导致不同items受益或受损，产生item-conditional效应。\n\n      (4) GPU×precision=0.4%：与inference结论一致——硬件因素在fine-tuning中同样可忽略。\n      training过程中的gradient accumulation引入了额外的数值非确定性(cuDNN autotuning,\n      nondeterministic reduction)，但binary scoring下这些差异仍不足以翻转大多数items。\n\n      inference vs fine-tuning的对比是一个独立发现：同一个evaluation framework(G-theory)\n      揭示了两种根本不同的方差regime——inference是\"measurement-dominated\"(item_id主导)，\n      fine-tuning是\"training-dominated\"(seed×lr主导)。这意味着reproducibility recipes\n      必须区分这两种使用场景。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 15: Inference vs fine-tuning variance decomposition\"\n        structure: \"Left columns=inference sources + %; Right columns=fine-tuning sources + %. Rows sorted by descending % within each column.\"\n        highlight: \"inference: item_id 60.4% #1; fine-tuning: seed×lr 28.4% #1, item_id 31.7% #2. Regime change.\"\n      - title: \"Supplementary Table S2: Fine-tuning variance by NLU task\"\n        structure: \"Rows=variance sources; Columns=SST-2, MNLI, RTE, COPA, Mean\"\n        highlight: \"item_id: SST-2 24.8 (easiest) → RTE 38.2 (hardest); seed×lr inversely related\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure (supplementary): Side-by-side stacked bars — inference(left, item_id=60% blue dominant)\n        vs fine-tuning(right, seed×lr=28% red + item_id=32% blue co-dominant).\n        Visual regime change immediately apparent. Arrow annotation: \"training-time variance sources\n        emerge and compete with item selection.\"\n    analysis: >\n      (1) 432 fine-tuning runs per task: for each (seed, lr, shuffle, gpu, precision) combination,\n      train RoBERTa-large for 3 epochs, evaluate on test set, collect item-level binary predictions；\n      (2) G-study with facets: seed, lr, data_shuffle, gpu, precision, item；\n      (3) Cross-task comparison of variance hierarchies；\n      (4) Formal comparison with inference results: test whether rank-order of sources differs\n      (Friedman test on component ranks, inference vs fine-tuning).\n      限制：仅encoder-only classification。decoder fine-tuning(LoRA on LLMs)需要\n      substantially更多compute，作为future work明确说明。\n\n  - name: \"LayerCast precision mitigation evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: >\n      在MMLU上测试LayerCast(FP16 storage + FP32 compute)作为第4个precision level,\n      量化这种mitigation策略对variance decomposition的影响。\n    expected_results:\n      total_new_records: 86400\n      layercast_accuracy: 0.709\n      layercast_vs_fp32_gap_pp: 0.3\n      layercast_vs_bf16_gap_pp: 0.2\n      precision_variance_reduction_pct: 65\n      precision_main_before: 1.4\n      precision_main_after: 0.5\n      precision_x_item_before: 2.8\n      precision_x_item_after: 1.0\n      other_components_change: \"<0.3pp on all non-precision sources\"\n      G_before: 0.618\n      G_after: 0.641\n      G_improvement: 0.023\n    result_rationale: >\n      LayerCast将precision方差降低65%的机制：LayerCast的混合精度(FP16存储+FP32计算)\n      在计算阶段维持了与纯FP32接近的数值精度，同时享受FP16的显存优势。\n      precision方差主要来自bf16/fp16/fp32之间的数值差异——LayerCast消除了\n      \"存储精度=计算精度\"的耦合，使其accuracy(70.9%)位于bf16(71.1%)和fp32(60.4%)\n      之间但非常接近bf16，表明FP32计算成功恢复了大部分精度。\n\n      precision×item从2.8%→1.0%的原因：没有LayerCast时，~15个\"边界items\"\n      (output logit差值<0.01)在不同precision下被翻转。LayerCast的FP32计算\n      使这些边界items的logit更精确，约10个不再翻转——但仍有~5个items因为\n      FP16权重的微小量化误差(mantissa截断)而保持翻转，贡献了剩余的1.0%。\n\n      G从0.618→0.641提升仅0.023因为precision×item只占总方差的2.8%——\n      消除大部分precision噪声只减少了分母中一个小组分，对G的提升有限。\n      这证实precision是一个real但不dominant的方差来源——值得mitigate但不是\n      提高reproducibility的primary lever(那是增加items)。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Supplementary Table S3: LayerCast impact on variance decomposition\"\n        structure: \"Rows=precision-related sources + G; Columns=3-precision (original), 4-precision (with LayerCast), delta\"\n        highlight: \"precision×item: 2.8→1.0 (↓64%); G: 0.618→0.641 (+0.023)\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      (1) 在exp-001 Llama design上增加LayerCast作为第4个precision条件\n      (1 model × 1 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 items)；\n      (2) 合并4个precision levels重新运行G-study；\n      (3) 比较3-precision和4-precision的decomposition，isolate LayerCast的影响；\n      (4) 定位LayerCast在practitioners的precision mitigation strategy中的价值。\n\n  - name: \"MATH benchmark — reasoning-heavy extension\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      MATH 200 items × 4 models × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps × 4 orderings.\n      测试chain-of-thought密集型任务的方差结构，扩展梯度至第5个benchmark。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 460800\n      single_model_item_id_pct: 22.1\n      prompt_x_item_pct: 13.5\n      seed_x_item_pct: 9.8\n      temp_x_item_pct: 14.2\n      precision_x_item_pct: 1.8\n      residual_pct: 24.6\n      other_and_small_interactions_pct: 14.0\n      single_model_G: 0.328\n      cross_model_model_x_item_pct: 24.8\n      cross_model_G: 0.035\n      d_study_items_G80: 1150\n      # --- Extended 5-benchmark gradient ---\n      extended_gradient_MMLU: 60.4\n      extended_gradient_HellaSwag: 50.4\n      extended_gradient_ARC: 42.1\n      extended_gradient_GSM8K: 28.3\n      extended_gradient_MATH: 22.1\n      extended_spread_pp: 38.3\n      extended_rank_correlation: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      MATH的item_id(22.1%)为全部benchmark最低的逐步解释：\n\n      MATH题目需要多步数学证明和推导(平均5-10步reasoning)，每一步都是一个\n      stochastic branching point——在T>0时，模型在每步可能选择不同的推理策略\n      (代数法 vs 几何法 vs 构造法)，而策略选择对不同item的影响截然不同。\n      这使得temperature×item=14.2%——MMLU(2.1%)的近7倍。物理机制：\n      MATH的chain-of-thought输出平均200-400 tokens，而MMLU只需选一个字母。\n      长输出中的sampling variance随token数累积(每个token的采样噪声叠加)，\n      使temperature的影响被系统性放大。\n\n      prompt×item=13.5%(MMLU的4.2倍)：MATH的few-shot exemplars不仅展示\n      答案格式，更展示\"如何推理\"。选择代数解法的exemplars会bias模型用代数思路，\n      选择图形推理的exemplars会bias模型画辅助线——不同推理策略在不同items上\n      效果差异巨大(代数法在方程题上强但在几何题上弱)，产生强prompt×item交互。\n\n      seed×item=9.8%反映了dropout和weight initialization在推理任务上的放大效应：\n      多步推理中，早期步骤的微小概率差异通过后续步骤被级联放大(error propagation)。\n\n      residual=24.6%高于其他benchmark因为MATH的chain-of-thought引入了大量\n      不可归因的随机变异——即使控制了所有设计facet，同一(model, precision, prompt,\n      seed, temperature, ordering)条件下的重复运行也因autoregressive sampling的\n      inherent stochasticity产生不同推理路径和不同结果。\n\n      G=0.328极低：当前200-item设计完全不可靠用于MATH评估。\n      D-study需要1150 items(MMLU的2.4倍)才达G≥0.80——这是chain-of-thought\n      引入的\"推理方差代价\"，对MATH/GPQA等reasoning benchmark有直接的实践意义。\n\n      model×item=24.8%(4模型)——4个benchmark中最高：不同模型的数学能力profile\n      差异极大(Qwen3可能擅长代数但弱于几何，Gemma反之)，导致model-specific的\n      item ranking在MATH上分歧最大。\n\n      5-benchmark梯度完美保持单调(rank corr=1.0)，spread扩至38.3pp(仍在[25,40]内)，\n      进一步强化核心叙事：方差结构沿knowledge→commonsense→science→arithmetic→proof\n      的认知复杂度轴系统性变化。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Supplementary Table S4: Extended 5-benchmark gradient\"\n        structure: \"Rows=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K, MATH; Columns=item_id%, prompt×item%, temp×item%, seed×item%, G, D-study items\"\n        highlight: \"item_id: 60.4→50.4→42.1→28.3→22.1; D-study: 480→550→650→900→1150\"\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Extended Figure 2 (5 bars): Five stacked bars MMLU→MATH. item_id wedge (blue)\n        progressively shrinks. prompt×item (orange) and temp×item (red) progressively grow.\n        Perfect visual gradient. MATH bar dominated by prompt×item+temp×item+residual,\n        with item_id as a minority component — stark contrast to MMLU.\n    analysis: >\n      (1) MATH evaluation需要specialized parsing: chain-of-thought output中提取final answer，\n      与gold answer做数学等价判定(symbolic equivalence, not string match)；\n      (2) 6 prompt templates设计为CoT strategy variants: zero-shot CoT, few-shot(algebra examples),\n      few-shot(geometry examples), few-shot(mixed), step-by-step, concise；\n      (3) 4 orderings不适用于MATH(开放生成)——替换为4组不同的few-shot exemplar sets；\n      (4) G-study + D-study与其他4个benchmark用identical pipeline处理；\n      (5) 更新跨benchmark梯度图至5个数据点，计算extended Spearman ρ。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"52656ab9-91b0-4a16-ba33-c6e3ee682184","total_cost_usd":1.2025622500000002,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14879,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":43748,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"st